            <pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 15:58:10 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>20</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>Notes get blocks: pictures, text sections, copyable hashtags and checklists. Notebooks get colours, icons and drag-to-reorder. Tap any to-do or reminder on Today to edit it, and every note records when and where it was written. Plus a fix for events saved as to-dos.</p>]]></description>
